Why return an API Resource instead of returning the Employee model directly?
API Resource Used to control how models are converted into API responses. We use it when we want to only expose the required model attributes to the api client instead of showing all the model attributes. This helps us to hide model attributes which are not necessary or which are for security purpose not exposed to the api client.

What does the RefreshDatabase trait do? What happens to your tests if it is not used and you run them twice?
RefreshDatabase is used for making the database records empty after the test has run with results. If I run first test without RefreshDatabase and then try to run the same test again second time the UniqueConstraintViolationException show up as some of the records are already inserted in the first test.

